Just ahead, Valeros spots two dead horses sprawled across the trail, each pierced by several black-feathered arrows. The sight sends a chill down his spine—these horses belonged to Gundren Rockseeker and Sildar Hallwinter, who have ventured into danger not too long ago.

With his successful Dexterity (Stealth) check, Valeros remains hidden, able to watch unseen. He notices movement in the thickets on either side of the path. Though his heart pounds with anticipation, his calm demeanor serves him well as he scans for further danger.

