[32m│[0m  [92mContent: The trail from the goblin ambush site [0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mleads to the entrance of the Cragmaw hideout.  [0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92m>>Following the goblins' trail, you come across[0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92ma large cave in a hillside five miles from the [0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mscene of the ambush. A shallow stream flows out[0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mof the cave mouth, which is screened by dense [0m   [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mbriar thickets. A narrow dry path leads into [0m    [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mthe cave on the right-hand side of the stream.[0m   [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92m>>  [0m                                             [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mThe thicket in area 2 is impenetrable from the [0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mwest side of the stream.  [0m                       [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92m#### Developments  [0m                              [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mThe goblins in area 2 are supposed to be [0m        [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mkeeping watch on this area, but they are not [0m    [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mpaying attention. (Goblins can be lazy that [0m     [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mway.) However, if the characters make a lot of [0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mnoise here—for example, loudly arguing about [0m    [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mwhat to do next, setting up a camp, cutting [0m     [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mdown brush, and so on—the goblins in area 2 [0m     [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mnotice and attack them through the thicket, [0m     [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mwhich provides the goblins with three-quarters [0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mcover (see the rulebook for rules on cover).[0m     [32m│[0m
