[32m│[0m  [92mmodifier (+6) to the roll, and compare the [0m      [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mresult to the characters' passive Wisdom [0m        [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92m(Perception) scores. Any character whose score [0m  [32m│[0m
