[32m│[0m  [92mAttack Rolls[0m                                     [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mWhen you make an attack, your attack roll [0m       [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mdetermines [0m                                      [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mwhether the attack hits or misses. To make an [0m   [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mattack [0m                                          [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mroll, roll a d20 and add the appropriate [0m        [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mmodifiers. If the [0m                               [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mtotal of the roll plus modifiers equals or [0m      [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mexceeds the [0m                                     [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mtarget’s Armor Class (AC), the attack hits. The[0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mAC of a [0m                                         [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mcharacter is determined at character creation, [0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mwhereas [0m                                         [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mthe AC of a monster is in its stat block.[0m        [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mModifiers to the Roll[0m                            [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mWhen a character makes an attack roll, the two [0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mmost [0m                                            [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mcommon modifiers to the roll are an ability [0m     [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mmodifier [0m                                        [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mand the character’s proficiency bonus. When a [0m   [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mmonster [0m                                         [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mmakes an attack roll, it uses whatever modifier[0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mis [0m                                              [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mprovided in its stat block.[0m                      [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92m Ability Modifier. The ability modifier used [0m    [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mfor a melee [0m                                     [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mweapon attack is Strength, and the ability [0m      [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mmodifier used [0m                                   [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mfor a ranged weapon attack is Dexterity. [0m        [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mWeapons that [0m                                    [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mhave the finesse or thrown property break this [0m  [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mrule.[0m                                            [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92m Some spells also require an attack roll. The [0m   [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mability[0m                                          [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mSource: [0m                                         [32m│[0m
