[32m│[0m                                                   [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mContent: 73D&D Player’s Basic Rules v0.2 | [0m      [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mChapter 9: Combat[0m                                [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mMaking an Attack[0m                                 [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mWhether you’re striking with a melee weapon, [0m    [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mfiring a [0m                                        [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mweapon at range, or making an attack roll as [0m    [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mpart of a [0m                                       [32m│[0m
[32m│[0m  [92mspell, an attack has a simple structure.[0m         [32m│[0m
